### Variáveis
@host = http://localhost:4000

### Registrar usuário com sucesso (espera 201 No Body)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joao Silva",
  "email": "joao.integration@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Registrar usuário duplicado (espera 409 user.email.already.exists)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joao Silva",
  "email": "joao.integration@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Senha fraca (espera 422 user.password.strong.password)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria.weak@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### E-mail inválido (espera 422 user.email.invalid.email)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "nao-email",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Múltiplos erros simultâneos (espera 422 com errors[] contendo várias chaves)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "bad",
  "password": "123"
}

### Campos faltando (espera 422 com user.<campo>.required)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Login com credenciais válidas (espera 200 { token, user })
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.integration@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Login com e-mail inexistente (espera 401 user.credentials.invalid)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ninguem@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Login com senha incorreta (espera 401 user.credentials.invalid)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.integration@example.com",
  "password": "SenhaErrada@123"
}

### Login com e-mail inválido (espera 422 user.email.invalid.email)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nao-email",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Login com corpo incompleto (espera 422 user.<campo>.required)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

